          "knowHeading": "Did you know?",
          "know": "Mack Remanufactured carriers are better than the originals, as they receive the latest engineering updates.\n\nOnly the OEM can bring the product up to the current OE specifications. Other rebuilders do not have access to these engineering specs.\n\nThe Middletown Reman plant technicians have years of experience and ONLY work on genuine Mack carriers.\n\nEvery ReMack carrier comes with a 2 year/unlimited mileage warranty.",
          "photo": {
            "src": "https://vendure.ai4dealerships.com/assets/source/bb/10001__04.jpg",
            "alt": "A Mack remanufactured carrier with its numbered features marked",
            "width": 824,
            "height": 736
